Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.79,0:00:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.87,0:00:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"English Grammar Workout: 700+ Tough Drills"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You find what you were looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.95,0:00:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Maybe I should just order it in...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You could ask a clerk to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'll just keep looking for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.37,0:00:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmkay, I'm gonna grab this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll come with you.\NI'm gonna buy something, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.58,0:01:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.75,0:01:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got some game magazines\Nover there! Lemme show you, c'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.83,0:01:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.54,0:01:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Horimiya"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.91,0:02:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Toru!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.16,0:02:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You taking out the trash?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.12,0:02:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup. You grab the burnables.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.79,0:02:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm helping you now? Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.12,0:03:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's heavy as shit! I see what\Nyou're doing, Yoshikawa. Real smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.66,0:03:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What could you possibly be talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.08,0:03:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"You're Here, I'm Here"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.04,0:03:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! That DVD I wanted is out today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.33,0:03:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me to pick it up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Urgh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let you borrow it later!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The actor playing the shopkeeper is so hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.95,0:03:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,--And not just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.66,0:03:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,--Ever since Hori and Miyamura started dating,\N--And not just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.41,0:03:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,--Yoshikawa's been giving me lots of attention.\N--And not just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.20,0:03:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,--Are you even listening to me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.29,0:03:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,--I {\i1}am{\i0}, thank you!\N--Are you even listening to me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,--I {\i1}am{\i0}, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, you're so annoy--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.29,0:03:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kono-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.00,0:03:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?! I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.50,0:03:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I was the one who ran into {\i1}you{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.79,0:03:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.41,0:03:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.70,0:03:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.75,0:03:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry! We gotta watch where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.20,0:03:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.16,0:04:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I really hope it doesn't leave a stain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.95,0:04:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yoshikawa-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.37,0:04:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Are you dating Ishikawa-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.00,0:04:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we're not dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.00,0:04:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.08,0:04:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure if you'd be able\Nto wear that home, Kono-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And I figured Yoshikawa's\Nis probably too small...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Ishikawa"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And I figured Yoshikawa's\Nis probably too small...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Ishikawa"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine's gonna be big, but at least\Nit's something. Sorry again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.62,0:04:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine's gonna be big, but at least\Nit's something. Sorry again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.20,0:04:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?! You want me to wear this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.50,0:04:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap, I should've just brought you yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.91,0:04:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I'll borrow yours! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.91,0:04:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Student Council Room"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.54,0:04:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the jacket?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.50,0:05:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.79,0:05:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Remi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.91,0:05:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she had to head home\Nto take care of some stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.62,0:05:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She did open the window, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.75,0:05:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She's keeping on top of her window duty, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.20,0:05:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sengoku-kun.\NWhat is it that you like about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.12,0:05:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe {\i1}you're {\i0}asking me that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.83,0:05:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I-Is it {\i1}that {\i0}shocking for me to ask?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.29,0:05:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess the fact that she's not\Nvery strong, so she needs me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.16,0:05:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So you want someone weak to stand\Nnext to you to make {\i1}you {\i0}look strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.25,0:05:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it! I don't control her,\Njust, like, I want to {\i1}protect {\i0}her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.62,0:05:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She makes me want to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.58,0:06:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's kind of what I like about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.12,0:06:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not even that strong in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.00,0:06:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But Remi makes me want to\Nbe stronger, if just for her sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.50,0:06:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Because she's behind me, pushing me forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.87,0:06:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the strength to give\Nher the push she needs, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.66,0:06:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, she's protecting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.83,0:06:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like how she protects you, right, Sakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.79,0:06:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You look really cute, Sakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.91,0:06:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.75,0:06:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She gives me courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.58,0:06:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Courage to try just a little bit harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.91,0:07:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.12,0:07:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Kono-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.20,0:07:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for lending me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.83,0:07:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry it took me so long to give\Nit back. I wanted to wash it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.66,0:07:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww, you didn't have to\Ngo through all that trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.95,0:07:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,--It's okay. Thank you again for the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.75,0:07:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,--Ishikawa! Can I borrow you, dude?\N--It's okay. Thank you again for the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,--Ishikawa! Can I borrow you, dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.91,0:07:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.66,0:07:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.66,0:07:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.79,0:07:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I made too many cookies, so, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.25,0:07:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Are those for me? Sweet, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.45,0:07:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I hope you like them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.54,0:07:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, these are great! I'm impressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.12,0:07:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially these {\i1}sakura{\i0}-pink ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.83,0:07:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Do you like Sakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.83,0:07:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sakura{\i0}? Yeah, I love {\i1}sakura{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:07:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.95,0:08:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.62,0:08:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but if you make these again,\Nbring more! I love 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.33,0:08:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Took you long enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.66,0:08:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.79,0:08:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice! I got the last one--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.29,0:08:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you do that, Yuki?\NYou've been looking for that forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.62,0:08:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,She looked like she wanted it,\Nand I can always find it another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.87,0:08:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no biggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.66,0:08:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa, someone's lookin' for ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.83,0:08:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.75,0:08:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.62,0:08:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you and Toru\Ntogether for a bit. Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.83,0:09:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. He's probably off\Nsomewhere eating cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.95,0:09:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.29,0:09:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Peach Tea"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've only known her for three years,\Nbut I can read her pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.25,0:09:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, we've got study hall next! Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.33,0:09:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The less she wants you to know\Nshe's upset, the bigger she smiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when she desperately wants something,\Nshe'll never say so out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.62,0:09:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And she'll never say "I love this"\Nor "I want this" with all her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.29,0:09:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So the things she loves or\Nwants tend to escape her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.54,0:09:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to thank you for\Nlending me that handkerchief.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.83,0:09:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm good, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.41,0:10:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Wow, I love cookies!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.54,0:10:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Kono-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.87,0:10:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,For real, though, thanks, Kono-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.70,0:10:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you like them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.45,0:10:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I do! They're so frickin' good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.41,0:10:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.16,0:10:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.08,0:10:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Might as well just take them\Nif they're gonna be this good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.50,0:10:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.79,0:10:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? A cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I've never made one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.58,0:10:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't have to be fancy.\NI just want it to taste good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.45,0:10:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that's kind of hard, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.91,0:11:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Yoshikawa-san,\NI wasn't born knowing how to bake a cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.50,0:11:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.62,0:11:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody's good at anything when they first start.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.75,0:11:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If you mess up, just give it another shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.45,0:11:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.45,0:11:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.00,0:11:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,These took you a whole {\i1}week{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.70,0:11:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They're {\i1}cupcakes{\i0}, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.95,0:11:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We're really starting from\Nsquare one, here, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you want Toru in on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.87,0:11:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,B-Because he'd totally make fun of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.62,0:11:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't, especially if he\Nknew you're making them for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.66,0:11:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not making them for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.45,0:11:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You having a party? Why wasn't I invited?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.12,0:11:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a cupcake?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.79,0:11:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.91,0:12:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, these taste like crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.95,0:12:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.66,0:12:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, absolute crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.41,0:12:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.54,0:12:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't wait for the next batch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.62,0:12:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Same!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.04,0:12:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.25,0:12:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.16,0:12:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura went up to Hokkaido, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's visiting family\Nup there for five days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.54,0:12:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So he won't be here all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.79,0:12:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, then I'll have to\Nread different lines in class!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.79,0:12:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura was gonna read the fifth line, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.95,0:12:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, now mine's super long!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.08,0:12:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this one's way easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.75,0:13:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Made it to Hokkaido. It's a lot cooler up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.12,0:13:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My battery's almost dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.41,0:13:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And I forgot my charger...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, can I borrow your phone charger?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.91,0:13:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, does mine work with yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.20,0:13:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.04,0:13:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.54,0:13:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we go to the convenience store?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.33,0:13:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're a little busy, honey.\NI can't drive you anywhere right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.20,0:13:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold tight for a bit, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.58,0:13:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna drink two?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.29,0:13:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, uh, I'm thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.41,0:13:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta stay hydrated in this heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.95,0:13:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep downing those sugary drinks\Nand you'll get fat, Yoshikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.91,0:13:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Three more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.62,0:14:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Made it to Hokkaido\NIt's a lot cooler up here"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye, Hori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.75,0:14:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.87,0:14:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you waiting for someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.12,0:14:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.95,0:14:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.83,0:14:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.79,0:14:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoko, that isn't my bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.33,0:14:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's my bro's bowl!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to push my buttons or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.91,0:14:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I just forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.29,0:14:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Guess even {\i1}you {\i0}slip up now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.79,0:15:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Yogurt Farm"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.29,0:15:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Yogurt Farm"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.29,0:15:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura comes back today, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.79,0:15:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura comes back today, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.29,0:15:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometime this evening, right?\NOr later than that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.66,0:15:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.16,0:15:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I wanna watch {\i1}Hurricane Star{\i0}!\NIt's already started!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.62,0:15:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why're you binging the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.75,0:15:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Our next story tonight: carry-on\Nrestrictions at airports continue to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.41,0:15:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.79,0:15:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kyoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.20,0:15:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.79,0:15:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Shindo, Shindo...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.45,0:15:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa-kun says the test\Ngot postponed. Aww, man...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.29,0:15:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Hori-san"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.58,0:15:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Izumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.62,0:16:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You big dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.25,0:16:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I never knew how long five days could feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.75,0:16:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.29,0:16:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh... thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.91,0:16:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.54,0:17:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Hurry up and get back here, dummy."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.54,0:17:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Student Council Room"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.12,0:17:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Student Council Room"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.12,0:17:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What doesn't he like?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What doesn't he like?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.37,0:17:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura doesn't like horror movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.37,0:17:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But he'll still watch them with me,\Nso maybe he does like 'em after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.08,0:17:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're making him watch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.87,0:17:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hori,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.50,0:17:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,you're gonna push him away if you\Nkeep watching all that scary stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.87,0:17:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.37,0:17:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A cute girl gleefully watching\Nslasher flicks is pretty creepy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.04,0:17:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon now, I'm not {\i1}that {\i0}cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.45,0:17:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't the point there, Hori.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.37,0:17:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree with Yoshikawa! It's a total turnoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.45,0:17:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.58,0:17:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I borrowed this for us, Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.58,0:17:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It has lots of dogs in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.20,0:17:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we watch {\i1}Right Behind You:{\i0}\N{\i1}The Third Nightmare {\i0}instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.87,0:17:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.25,0:18:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna push him away if you\Nkeep watching all that scary stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.37,0:18:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura, so, uh, this movie's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.87,0:18:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...gonna be pretty scary, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.62,0:18:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.08,0:18:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to the PG-13 gorefests we always watch,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.25,0:18:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,this G-rated one's totally harmless!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.83,0:18:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.54,0:18:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You should pretend to be scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.37,0:18:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.08,0:18:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You scared me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.66,0:18:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayasaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.04,0:18:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe this just won't work...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.41,0:18:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you could hold his hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.25,0:18:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I'm so scared...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.87,0:18:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to have fun\Nwatching a movie with him...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.12,0:18:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm such a scaredy-cat. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.00,0:18:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No, don't apologize!\NIt's not your fault, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.58,0:19:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. Give me a second, I need a moment alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.12,0:19:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's totally done with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.50,0:19:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.25,0:19:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.79,0:19:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.45,0:19:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.37,0:19:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not cute at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.54,0:19:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What do you mean? You're really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.41,0:19:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get scared. I can't even {\i1}act {\i0}scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.70,0:19:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything cute. I'm hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.95,0:19:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, were you doing all that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares, you big dummy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.25,0:19:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Hori-san. I was too\Nfreaked-out and scared to notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.45,0:19:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do {\i1}you {\i0}keep apologizing to {\i1}me{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.91,0:19:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me, dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.45,0:19:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the big dummy here, Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.25,0:19:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't fall in love with\Na "normal girl." I fell for {\i1}you{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.83,0:20:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go watch the rest of the movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.62,0:20:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's raining pretty hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.04,0:20:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.33,0:20:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I did, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.66,0:20:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell for {\i1}him{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.12,0:20:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,His long eyelashes, his scaredy-cat jumps,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.50,0:20:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,his sarcastic quips,\Nhow thin he feels in my arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.58,0:20:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,His voice, and... and...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.58,0:20:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Izumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.83,0:20:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.87,0:20:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm listening to your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.83,0:20:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.25,0:20:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How cold it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.12,0:21:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hands and ears are really cold, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.62,0:21:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably from the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.04,0:21:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.87,0:21:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't go home in this downpour.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.95,0:21:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a heat within me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.12,0:21:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and I wanted Miyamura to feel it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.25,0:21:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's you, me, and my big sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.66,0:21:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sota?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, she's... {\i1}my {\i0}big sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.79,0:21:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you worried I'll take her away from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.41,0:21:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't. She's {\i1}your {\i0}big sister, Sota.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.70,0:21:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're my bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.95,0:21:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm your big bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.66,0:21:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't take your big sister away, Sota.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.79,0:22:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But could I have Kyoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.25,0:22:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.62,0:23:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Next Time: The Truth Deception Reveals"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.62,0:23:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.20,0:23:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hair's getting longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.25,0:23:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you cut it again, everyone'll see that mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.00,0:23:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd she bite you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.95,0:23:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.58,0:23:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a mark of ownership,\Nbut maybe I shouldn't tell him that.
